-// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
-/******************************************************************************
- * rtl8712_led.c
- *
- * Copyright(c) 2007 - 2010  Realtek Corporation. All rights reserved.
- * Linux device driver for RTL8192SU
- *
- * Modifications for inclusion into the Linux staging tree are
